OL,3,GNEWSATriathlete was 'very sick' in
OL,4,Ahospital after swimming in 'dirty' open
OL,5,Awater
OL,6,
OL,7,FA triathlete who travels the world to
OL,8,Ftake part in races says making his
OL,9,Fdreams come true comes with serious
OL,10,Frisk after one event led to him being
OL,11,F"very sick" in hospital.
OL,13,FAndrew Jones, from Carmarthen, takes
OL,14,Fpart in various events, and has even
OL,15,Fearned a slot in the Ironman World
OL,16,FChampionship in Kona, Hawaii this
OL,17,Fmonth.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
