OL,3,GNEWSATriathlete was 'very sick' in
OL,4,Ahospital after swimming in 'dirty' open
OL,5,Awater
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut the triathlete said swimming in
OL,8,F"dirty" open-water made him very unwell
OL,9,Fahead of the event after he contracted
OL,10,FCampylobacter, an infection caused by
OL,11,Fbacteria.
OL,13,FTriathlon Cymru said its Safer Blue
OL,14,FSpaces project, which is the first of
OL,15,Fits kind, was now using small sampling
OL,16,Fdevices on triathletes to test the
OL,17,Fwater and provide reliable data on
OL,18,Fwater quality in Wales.
